{"info": {"address1": "Sona Enclave", "address2": "Unit I, Unit II & Unit III Village Begumpur, Khatola, Sector 35 Post box no. 90", "city": "Gurugram", "zip": "122004", "country": "India", "phone": "91 12 4476 8200", "website": "https://www.sonacomstar.com", "industry": "Auto Parts", "industryKey": "auto-parts", "industryDisp": "Auto Parts", "sector": "Consumer Cyclical", "sectorKey": "consumer-cyclical", "sectorDisp": "Consumer Cyclical", "longBusinessSummary": "Sona BLW Precision Forgings Limited, together with its subsidiaries, designs, manufactures, and supplies systems and components for the automotive industry in India, North America, Europe, and Asia. The company offers mobility products comprising electronically locking differentials, integrated motor controller modules, traction motors, spool gears, controllers, input/rotor shafts, starter motors, differential assembly and bevel gears, intermediate and portal axle gears, epicyclic geartrains, reduction drive units, in-cabin radar and short range radar sensors, steering bevel boxes, coupling/sleeves, inter-axle gear sets, hub wheel motors, integrated hub motors and controllers, and integrated drive motors and controllers. It also provides railway components comprising brake systems, couplers, suspension systems, friction and rubber products, HVAC systems, electric control panels, vacuum evacuation systems, and automatic plug doors. In addition, the company offers non-automotive components, such as AVG/AMR drive units, industrial robot and eVOLT reduction gearboxes, short range radar and zone monitoring sensors, humanoid components, and eVOLT and humanoid motors. It exports its products. The company's products are used in conventional and electric passenger vehicles, commercial vehicles, off-highway vehicles, buses, and electric two and three-wheelers, as well as for railways and non-automotive applications. The company was formerly known as Sona Okegawa Precision Forgings Ltd. and changed its name to Sona BLW Precision Forgings Limited in July 2013. Sona BLW Precision Forgings Limited was incorporated in 1995 and is headquartered in Gurugram, India.", "companyOfficers": [{"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Vivek Vikram Singh", "age": 46, "title": "MD, Group CEO & Executive Director", "yearBorn": 1979, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 31720000, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Rohit  Nanda CA", "age": 52, "title": "Group CFO & Chief Risk Officer", "yearBorn": 1973, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 30120000, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Ranganathan  Balaji", "age": 55, "title": "Chief Operating Officer", "yearBorn": 1970, "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Praveen Chakrapani Rao", "age": 55, "title": "Group CTO & SVP R&D Management", "yearBorn": 1970, "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Amit  Mishra", "title": "Vice President of Investor Relationship & Group Head of CSR", "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Vadapalli Vikram Verma", "age": 65, "title": "Chief Executive Officer of Driveline Division & Director", "yearBorn": 1960, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 12200000, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. M  Vaithiyanathan", "title": "President & Chief Operating Officer of Motor Business", "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Sat Mohan Gupta", "age": 63, "title": "Chief Executive Officer of  Motor Business", "yearBorn": 1962, "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Anand  Seth", "title": "Assistant Vice President of Marketing", "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Pratik  Sachan", "title": "Head of Strategy & M&A", "fiscalYear": 2025, "exerc